From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:40:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rasterize recorded scenes in bounded row bands

Allow a destination pixmap to start at an aligned scene row, so a caller can render a
recorded scene band by band without allocating its full pixel buffer. Glyph resources are
prepared once and kept with the recorded context until every band is rendered.
